WEBVTT

1
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:18,750
You dare to attack me

2
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:20,630
It's a pity that it's just a little bit close

3
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:21,820
Impossible

4
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:24,900
I obviously didn't smell any other mice just now

5
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:28,870
He is not a wife but a child

6
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:31,900
Only now do I know it's too late

7
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,380
I just told you about the little gift for you

8
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:35,380
what is this

9
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:38,660
Can turn living people into weird candies in a short time

10
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,900
ate it

11
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:44,460
Maybe you can let me have a ghost baby. I have something else to do.

12
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:47,510
Let's go first

13
00:00:47,510 --> 00:00:48,870
Although I didn't expect it

14
00:00:48,870 --> 00:00:50,870
That candy can be useful at times like this
